  "selection": "234 selected original project files. Original font.h includes uppercase A.xpm through Z.xpm. The 26 unused lowercase variants cannot coexist with them on a case-insensitive filesystem, so they are omitted from the live selected tree and preserved, with every original project file, in ORIGINAL_PROJECT.tar.gz. Every one of the 260 archived files was verified against its pinned Git blob identity. No original assets were changed.",
  "controlsRationale": "Original relative cursor starts at (200, 200) with unit deltas. It has no source clamp, so no direct or calibrated preset is enabled. The horizontal A/D pad moves the wraith, and Select / Cast preserves the original left mouse input for menu choice and aimed magic. Escape preserves the original clean exit. Auto orientation leaves game and controls usable in portrait. No timing, RNG, graphics mode or game-presentation changes.",
